{"seq":3,"slug":"query-slice-drilldown","title":"按市场/品类/语言切片下钻","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-relevance-online-monitoring/badcase-detect-cluster/query-slice-drilldown","wordCount":2390,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"按市场-品类-语言切片下钻\">按市场/品类/语言切片下钻</h1><p>告警告诉你「印尼站的零结果率异常」。这句话的信息量接近于零，因为印尼站有手机配件、美妆、家居、服饰等几十个品类，有印尼语、英语、以及大量混写 query，有 iOS、Android、以及 App 内嵌浏览器三个端。真正可执行的问题描述必须收窄到「印尼站 / 手机配件 / 印尼语无空格 query / Android」，这个收窄过程就是下钻。</p>\n<p>下钻的难点不在于「能不能按维度分组」——这在 SQL 里是一行 <code>GROUP BY</code> 的事。难点在于<strong>维度组合的爆炸</strong>：市场 × 品类 × 语言 × 端类型 × 版本，全组合轻松上万个格子，每个格子分到的流量少到无法判定。这一篇讲的就是如何在不爆维度的前提下把一次劣化收敛到可执行粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-切片维度的选择\">核心概念：切片维度的选择</h2><p>不是所有维度都值得切。维度的选择标准是<strong>它是否对应一个独立的失效机制</strong>——如果两个维度的取值变化不会导致不同的失效模式，那么切开它们只是增加噪声。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>为什么值得切</th>\n<th>失效机制</th>\n<th>基数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场</td>\n<td>索引、商品池、物流规则都按市场隔离</td>\n<td>索引不同步、品类结构差异</td>\n<td>10–50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言/locale</td>\n<td>分词器按语言配置</td>\n<td>分词错误、停用词表</td>\n<td>5–30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类</td>\n<td>类目树、过滤器、属性都按品类</td>\n<td>类目映射、属性过滤</td>\n<td>100–3000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端类型</td>\n<td>结果页布局与曝光位次不同</td>\n<td>倾向性差异、埋点差异</td>\n<td>2–4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序/索引版本</td>\n<td>直接对应变更</td>\n<td>版本劣化</td>\n<td>每次发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>品类是高基数维度</strong>，直接全量切分不可行。处理方式是把品类按<strong>类目树层级</strong>分组——先看一级类目（约 10–30 个），异常定位后再下到二级（约 100–300 个），必要时才到三级。这个「逐层收窄」的策略是下钻的核心方法，下一节展开。类目树本身的质量直接影响下钻的准确性：如果类目树层级过浅或节点定义重叠，同一批商品会被分到多个节点，下钻结果会出现「同一个问题在三个类目里各算一遍」的重复计数。类目树的扩展与对齐属于数据治理范畴，可参考本仓库中关于用户行为驱动的品类体系扩展的实践（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.14921\">Product Taxonomy Expansion with User Behaviors Supervision</a>，arXiv:2203.14921）。</p>\n<p>语言维度有一个容易忽略的陷阱：<strong>query 的语言不等于市场的语言</strong>。印尼站的用户会用英语写「iphone case」，会用英语和印尼语混写「casing hp iphone」，也会用中文写「手机壳」。按市场切分会把这三种语言混在一起，而它们的分词失效机制完全不同。所以语言切片必须基于<strong>语言检测结果</strong>而不是市场默认 locale。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[整体指标异常] --&gt; B{按市场拆}&#10;  B --&gt;|集中在1-2个市场| C{按语言检测拆}&#10;  B --&gt;|普遍上升| H[可能是全局变更或季节因素]&#10;  C --&gt;|集中在特定语言| D[怀疑分词/语言配置]&#10;  C --&gt;|各语言均分| E{按一级类目拆}&#10;  E --&gt;|集中在1个类目| F[怀疑类目映射/属性过滤]&#10;  E --&gt;|分散| G{按端类型与版本拆}&#10;  G --&gt; I[怀疑展示或版本变更]&#10;  F --&gt; J[下钻到二级类目确认]&#10;  D --&gt; K[进入根因诊断-分词层]\">graph TD\n  A[整体指标异常] --&gt; B{按市场拆}\n  B --&gt;|集中在1-2个市场| C{按语言检测拆}\n  B --&gt;|普遍上升| H[可能是全局变更或季节因素]\n  C --&gt;|集中在特定语言| D[怀疑分词/语言配置]\n  C --&gt;|各语言均分| E{按一级类目拆}\n  E --&gt;|集中在1个类目| F[怀疑类目映射/属性过滤]\n  E --&gt;|分散| G{按端类型与版本拆}\n  G --&gt; I[怀疑展示或版本变更]\n  F --&gt; J[下钻到二级类目确认]\n  D --&gt; K[进入根因诊断-分词层]</pre><h2 id=\"逐层收窄的算法\">逐层收窄的算法</h2><p>下钻的正确做法是<strong>广度优先逐层收窄</strong>，而不是一次把所有维度组合起来。一次性给 SQL 加上五个 <code>GROUP BY</code> 字段，得到的是上万个稀疏格子，其中绝大多数流量不足；而逐层收窄每一步只增加一个维度，且每一步都用上一步的结论缩小范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 第 1 步: 确认异常集中在哪个市场 (只看总量)&#10;SELECT market,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN result_count = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)::float / COUNT(*) AS zero_rate,&#10;       COUNT(*) AS requests&#10;FROM search_requests&#10;WHERE ts BETWEEN &#39;2026-09-27 00:00&#39; AND &#39;2026-09-27 23:59&#39;&#10;GROUP BY market&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 5000&#10;ORDER BY zero_rate DESC;&#10;&#10;-- 第 2 步: 在异常市场内按语言检测结果拆&#10;SELECT detected_lang, zero_rate, requests&#10;FROM (&#10;  SELECT detected_lang,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN result_count = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)::float / COUNT(*) AS zero_rate,&#10;         COUNT(*) AS requests&#10;  FROM search_requests&#10;  WHERE market = &#39;ID&#39;&#10;    AND ts BETWEEN &#39;2026-09-27 00:00&#39; AND &#39;2026-09-27 23:59&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY detected_lang&#10;) t&#10;WHERE requests &gt;= 500&#10;ORDER BY zero_rate DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 第 1 步: 确认异常集中在哪个市场 (只看总量)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-27 00:00'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-27 23:59'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 第 2 步: 在异常市场内按语言检测结果拆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detected_lang, zero_rate, requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detected_lang,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ID'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-27 00:00'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-27 23:59'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detected_lang</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每一步都带一个<strong>最小流量门槛</strong>（<code>HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 5000</code>、<code>WHERE requests &gt;= 500</code>）。这个门槛的作用是把统计上不可判定的切片从结果里剔除，而不是让它们以巨大的置信区间混进排序——否则排序榜首永远是某个只有 3 次请求、恰好全部零结果的切片。</p>\n<h3 id=\"门槛应该设多少\">门槛应该设多少</h3><p>门槛不是随意取的，它由「要检出多大的相对差异」决定。粗略的经验规则是每个切片至少要有**能在基线上期望出现约 30 个「坏样本」**的流量。如果基线零结果率是 2%，要检出这个量级的波动，每个切片至少需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.02</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30 / 0.02 = 1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30/0.02</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span> 次请求。如果基线是 0.5%，门槛就要抬到 6000 次。用固定的绝对门槛（比如一律 500）会在低基线切片上产生大量假阳性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标基线</th>\n<th>期望坏样本数</th>\n<th>最小请求量门槛</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>零结果率 2%</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>1,500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果率 0.5%</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>6,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTR 5%</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>600</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加购率 1%</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>3,000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的实用价值在于它给出了**「这个切片至今无法判定」**这个结论的正当性：不是数据不够看，而是数学上不够。当运营同学要求「看看我们这个只有 200 次请求的小语种切片有没有问题」时，正确的回答是引用门槛而不是给出一个噪声数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相对指标与绝对指标的分工\">相对指标与绝对指标的分工</h2><p>下钻过程中有一个必做的判断：切片的异常是<strong>该切片自己的问题</strong>，还是它只是<strong>承接了整体趋势</strong>？一个市场今天零结果率涨了 1 个百分点，如果整体也涨了 1 个百分点，那么这个市场没有问题——问题在更上层。</p>\n<p>处理方式是同时维护两个视图：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视图</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绝对指标</td>\n<td>切片自身的指标值</td>\n<td>判断影响规模、优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对指标</td>\n<td>切片指标 / 同期整体指标</td>\n<td>判断是否为该切片特有问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当整体也在劣化时，相对指标能立刻给出「这个切片是不是特别差」。这个视图在跨市场对比时尤其重要：一个商品池较小、长尾占比高的市场天然零结果率更高，用绝对指标比较会误判它为「质量差」，用相对指标（与其自身历史基线比）才公平。</p>\n<h3 id=\"同-query-集合下钻\">同 query 集合下钻</h3><p>上面两种视图仍然受流量结构变化影响。最严格的对照是<strong>固定 query 集合</strong>：取一组在两个时间窗内都出现过的 query，只在这组 query 上比较。这样「今天来了更多长尾 query」这个因素被彻底消掉。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 固定 query 集合的后置对比: 只比较两周内都出现过的 query&#10;WITH common AS (&#10;  SELECT query_normalized&#10;  FROM search_requests&#10;  WHERE ts &gt;= now() - interval &#39;14 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY query_normalized&#10;  HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, ts)) &gt;= 12   -- 至少 12 天出现&#10;)&#10;SELECT r.market, r.detected_lang,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN r.ts &gt;= now() - interval &#39;1 day&#39; AND r.result_count = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)::float&#10;         / NULLIF(SUM(CASE WHEN r.ts &gt;= now() - interval &#39;1 day&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END), 0) AS zero_rate_today,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN r.ts &lt;  now() - interval &#39;1 day&#39; AND r.result_count = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)::float&#10;         / NULLIF(SUM(CASE WHEN r.ts &lt;  now() - interval &#39;1 day&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END), 0) AS zero_rate_baseline&#10;FROM search_requests r&#10;JOIN common c USING (query_normalized)&#10;GROUP BY r.market, r.detected_lang&#10;HAVING SUM(CASE WHEN r.ts &gt;= now() - interval &#39;1 day&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) &gt;= 500;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 固定 query 集合的后置对比: 只比较两周内都出现过的 query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> common </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_normalized</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'14 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_normalized</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ts)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   -- 至少 12 天出现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">detected_lang</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">result_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_rate_today,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">result_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_rate_baseline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_requests r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> common c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (query_normalized)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">detected_lang</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询把「今天 vs 基线」放在同一个 <code>GROUP BY</code> 里同时算出，避免了两次查询之间数据漂移带来的误差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下钻的停止条件\">下钻的停止条件</h2><p>下钻必须有一个明确的停止条件，否则会一路钻到单条 query，既没有统计意义也浪费人力。三个停止条件是充分的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>流量门槛</strong>：切片流量低于该指标所需的最小门槛（见前面的表）时停止。</li>\n<li><strong>归因明确</strong>：切片已经收窄到与某个失效机制一一对应，例如「印尼语 + 无空格 query」已经明确指向分词层，再往下钻不会改变结论。这个停止条件的依据来自 <a href=\"../rootcause-diagnosis/recall-rank-data-attribution\">召回/排序/数据/分词根因归因</a> 的分层判据。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性消失</strong>：如果继续下钻发现异常在子切片间均匀分布（例如按品类拆开后，每个品类都差不多），说明上一层已经是正确的粒度，再往下只是在切分同一个分布。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第三条最容易被违反。一个常见的错误是：发现某市场异常后继续按品类拆，看到某个小品类零结果率 8%（因为它的流量只有 800，基线本来就高），于是误以为问题在那个品类。<strong>均匀分布在子切片上不是「问题不存在」，而是「问题在这个粒度之上」</strong>，此时应当回到上一层重新选择切分维度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"切片组合的交付格式\">切片组合的交付格式</h3><p>下钻的产出必须是<strong>结构化的问题描述</strong>，而不是一段自然语言。可执行的问题描述至少包含四个字段，缺任何一个都会导致后续环节重新下钻一遍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;issue_id&quot;: &quot;q_20260927_0014&quot;,&#10;  &quot;window&quot;: { &quot;start&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T10:00Z&quot;, &quot;end&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T14:00Z&quot; },&#10;  &quot;slice&quot;: { &quot;market&quot;: &quot;ID&quot;, &quot;detected_lang&quot;: &quot;id&quot;, &quot;device&quot;: &quot;android&quot;, &quot;category_l1&quot;: &quot;phone-accessories&quot; },&#10;  &quot;signal&quot;: { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;zero_result_rate&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.047, &quot;baseline&quot;: 0.012, &quot;min_requests_met&quot;: true },&#10;  &quot;sample_queries&quot;: [&quot;casinghpiphonepromax&quot;, &quot;sarunghpvivoy17&quot;],&#10;  &quot;cluster_ref&quot;: &quot;c_20260927_007&quot;,&#10;  &quot;hypothesis_layer&quot;: &quot;tokenization&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"issue_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"q_20260927_0014\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T10:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"end\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T14:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"slice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"detected_lang\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"device\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"category_l1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"phone-accessories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"signal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zero_result_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.047</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"baseline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.012</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_requests_met\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sample_queries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"casinghpiphonepromax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sarunghpvivoy17\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cluster_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c_20260927_007\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hypothesis_layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tokenization\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>min_requests_met</code> 字段是对切片可靠性的自我声明——它把「这个切片流量够不够判定」这个判断固化进数据里，而不是留给下游去猜。<code>cluster_ref</code> 指向 <a href=\"badcase-auto-cluster\">Badcase 自动聚簇</a> 产出的簇，让下钻与聚簇两条路径在这里汇合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>维度选择的标准是「是否对应独立的失效机制」，而非「是否能切」；品类是高基数维度，必须按类目树层级逐层展开。</li>\n<li>语言切片必须基于语言检测结果而非市场默认 locale，因为同一市场的用户会混用多种语言，其分词失效机制完全不同。</li>\n<li>下钻应广度优先逐层收窄，每一步只增加一个维度并带最小流量门槛，避免一次性交叉出上万个稀疏格子。</li>\n<li>流量门槛应由「期望坏样本数约 30」反推，随指标基线变化（2% 零结果率需 1500 次请求，0.5% 需 6000 次），固定绝对门槛会在低基线切片产生假阳性。</li>\n<li>必须同时维护绝对指标与相对指标视图以区分「切片特有问题」与「承接整体趋势」；最严格的对照是固定 query 集合的后置对比。</li>\n<li>三个停止条件：流量门槛、归因明确、子切片间异常均匀（说明粒度太细）；均匀分布不是「无问题」而是「问题在上层」。</li>\n<li>下钻交付物必须是结构化问题描述，含切片、信号、样本 query、簇引用与可靠性声明字段。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按市场/品类/语言切片下钻","id":"按市场-品类-语言切片下钻"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：切片维度的选择","id":"核心概念-切片维度的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"逐层收窄的算法","id":"逐层收窄的算法"},{"level":3,"text":"门槛应该设多少","id":"门槛应该设多少"},{"level":2,"text":"相对指标与绝对指标的分工","id":"相对指标与绝对指标的分工"},{"level":3,"text":"同 query 集合下钻","id":"同-query-集合下钻"},{"level":2,"text":"下钻的停止条件","id":"下钻的停止条件"},{"level":3,"text":"切片组合的交付格式","id":"切片组合的交付格式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"零结果与 CTR 骤降告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-relevance-online-monitoring/badcase-detect-cluster/zero-result-ctr-drop-alert"},"next":{"title":"召回/排序/数据/分词根因归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-relevance-online-monitoring/rootcause-diagnosis/recall-rank-data-attribution"}}